{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike mining tower defense with endless build variety!</strong> Mazing, gem merging, roguelike perks, and physics-driven combat collide to create chaotic defenses and wild synergies. <strong>Gem Miner TD\u00a0</strong>puts you in the role of a crafty miner tasked with creating deadly mazes, combining powerful gems, and surviving relentless waves. Every run feels fresh, unpredictable, and filled with dazzling chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features - Why You Will Dig It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Maze\u00a0-</strong> Mine and place blocks to shape the enemy\u2019s path, uncovering ores that become powerful defensive gem towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Defense -</strong>\u00a0Place gems to shoot down waves of enemies as they attempt to drag your miner to the lava pits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge Gem System -</strong> Merge gems of varying rarities to create increasingly powerful defenses. The more you merge, the more powerful you become! Or switch to a different game mode and use coins to upgrade your Gems instead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Perks -</strong> After defeating bosses, choose from roguelike-style upgrades to customize your playstyle. Enhance your gems, empower your miner, or alter gameplay mechanics for a unique experience every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability -</strong> Multiple maps and game modes, numerous miners, countless gem combinations, powerful augments, and varied enemy types make every playthrough feel fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835780/extras/9932953bcf1700471cf872f8a155d58c.poster.avif?t=1764846590\" width=780 height=404 >